      "id": 1,
      "text": "Alvin was originally called Morgan, but the name was changed when another town in Texas already used it, so the residents chose the first name of the original settler, Alvin Morgan.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
